The API dependency graph and generic resolution implementation in
src/rapx_graph.rs, src/rapx_resolve.rs, and src/rapx_mono.rs adapts code from
RAPx (Rust Analysis Platform with Extensions), maintained by Artisan-Lab.

Upstream: https://github.com/Artisan-Lab/RAPx
Source: rapx/src/analysis/core/api_dependency/
License: Mozilla Public License 2.0 (see LICENSE-MPL).

These files have been modified for cargo-varies, including rustc API updates,
public API path resolution, and bounded generic solving for wrapper synthesis.
